            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ARRANCAR DESDE EL USB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start up in Recovery (⌘R) and, in Startup Security Utility, allow booting from external media." : {
      "comment" : "Done screen help. Use the macOS names of Recovery, the utility and the option.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
